      "description": "The live smoke test writes to the operator's real board; every record it creates is titled with the prefix [ab-cli smoke] and is deleted at the end. The operator's \"go\" on 2026-11-26 approved these writes.",
      "inDefinedTermSet": {
        "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:actionboard-pod-api-actionlists-goals-files:constraints"
